menu "Screaming Plant: Soil moisture sensor"

    config SOIL_MOISTURE_DRY_MV
        int "Sensor voltage when dry (mV)"
        range 0 3300
        default 2400
        help
            Sensor output voltage with the probe in dry air. Read the value from
            the log output and adjust it here (0 % moisture).

    config SOIL_MOISTURE_WET_MV
        int "Sensor voltage when wet (mV)"
        range 0 3300
        default 1100
        help
            Sensor output voltage with the probe in a glass of water (up to the
            marking line). Read the value from the log output and adjust it here
            (100 % moisture).

    config SOIL_MOISTURE_SAMPLES
        int "Samples averaged per reading"
        range 1 256
        default 16

    config SOIL_MOISTURE_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Measurement interval (ms)"
        range 100 3600000
        default 2000

endmenu
